      "name": "ProcessSlots",
      "signature": "undefined ProcessSlots(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined",
      "comment": "Processes all registered slots when initialized.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check g_dwInitialized flag\n2. Iterate through g_adSlotData array from 0x6f9f3ca8 to 0x6f9f3cc8\n3. For each slot, call Ordinal_10013 to get slot status\n4. If status is non-zero, call Ordinal_10024 to process with 0 and 200\n5. Advance to next slot (4-byte stride)\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x4 (4): Slot entry size in bytes\n- 0xc8 (200): Parameter to Ordinal_10024",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
