      "name": "LoadFileDataAndCacheEntry",
      "signature": "void LoadFileDataAndCacheEntry(char * szFilePath)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Loads file data and caches entry if magic matches expected value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if initialization flag is set\n2. Parse file using FUN_6f9e581c to extract file data\n3. Call Ordinal_10056 to process parsed data with magic validation\n4. If magic number is 0x5622, allocate cache entry and copy file path string\n5. Link new entry into global cache list via DAT_6f9f3ce4\n\nParameters:\n- szFilePath (char*): Path to file to load and cache\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x5622: Expected magic number for valid cache entries\n- 0x60: Size of allocated cache entry structure (96 bytes)\n- 0x5c, 0x50, 0x54, 0x58: Field offsets within cache structure",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
