      "name": "InitializeSoundConfig",
      "signature": "void InitializeSoundConfig(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize sound configuration from registry settings.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Set default sound configuration values\n2. Query registry for each sound setting (mixer, volumes, bias, speech, music)\n3. Validate each setting is within acceptable range (0-2 for mixer/speech, 0-100 for volumes, 0-1 for music)\n4. Apply setting if valid, otherwise keep default\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 3: Maximum mixer value\n- 0x65 (101): Maximum volume value\n- 2: Maximum NPC speech/music option value\n- 0x32 (50): Default values for music and positional bias volumes\n- 100: Default master volume",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:86c56857e36f9d967fbbb0ba943dc733",
