      "name": "RestoreFPUControlWord",
      "signature": "void RestoreFPUControlWord(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Restores FPU control word from stack if it differs from default.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Compare stack value (ESP) with default control word 0x27f\n2. If equal, skip FLDCW (jump to POP EDX)\n3. If different, load the stored control word via FLDCW\n4. Pop restored value into EDX and return\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: Stack contains FPU control word at [ESP]\n\nReturns:\n- void (FPU control word restored to stack value or left unchanged if default)",
