      "name": "ConvertFpuControlFlags",
      "signature": "dword ConvertFpuControlFlags(dword dwInputFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Converts FPU control word flags from one representation to another.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Translate input flag bits to output flag bits via bit-by-bit mapping\n2. Handle multi-bit mask translations (bits 8-9) with conditional checks\n3. Apply default values for unset flag groups (bits 16-17)\n4. Return translated output flags\n\nParameters:\n- dwInputFlags (dword): Input FPU control word or flag bits\n\nReturns:\n- dword: Translated output flags\n\nFlag Mappings:\n- Bit 4 \u2192 Bit 0\n- Bit 3 \u2192 Bit 2\n- Bit 2 \u2192 Bit 3\n- Bit 1 \u2192 Bit 4\n- Bit 0 \u2192 Bit 5\n- Bit 19 \u2192 Bit 1\n- Bits 8-9: 0x100\u21920x400, 0x200\u21920x800, 0x300\u21920xc00\n- Bits 16-17: 0\u21920x300, 0x10000\u21920x200, else bit 12 set\n- Bit 18 \u2192 Bit 12",
