      "name": "ProcessNumericParameter",
      "signature": "bool ProcessNumericParameter(uint dwFlags, double * pValue, uint dwOptions)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "bool",
      "comment": "Validates and processes numeric parameter value based on control flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Mask dwFlags to extract control bits (0x1f)\n2. Check flag combinations with dwOptions to determine processing path\n3. For flag combination 0x2 & 0x10: extract mantissa/exponent, apply normalization\n4. For flag combinations 0x1/0x8, 0x4/0x4: call FUN_6f9ec81b and adjust flags\n5. For other flag sets: apply pre-computed log2 results based on flag bits\n6. Final validation: check flags 0x10/0x20 combination\n\nParameters:\n- dwFlags (uint): Control flags determining processing path (bits 0x1f)\n- pValue (double*): Input/output floating-point value to process\n- dwOptions (uint): Option flags controlling flag combination checks\n\nReturns:\n- true if dwFlags becomes 0 after final bit mask operation, false otherwise",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
