      "name": "SetFpuControlWord",
      "signature": "void SetFpuControlWord(uint dwControl)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Sets FPU control word with specified exception masks and precision mode.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load control word from caller's stack parameter\n2. AND with 0x300 to preserve precision bits (bits 8-9)\n3. OR with 0x7f to enable exception masks (precision, underflow, overflow, etc.)\n4. Store modified control word to temporary stack location\n5. Load modified control word into FPU via FLDCW\n\nParameters:\n- wControl (uint): FPU control word from caller containing desired precision and exception settings\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies FPU control register as side effect)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x300: Mask preserving precision control bits (bits 8-9)\n- 0x7f: Exception enable mask (bits 0-6)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:2499e8fc59692f6e5479749bdf8573b2",
