      "name": "ConvertFPUControlWordToPlatform",
      "signature": "uint ConvertFPUControlWordToPlatform(uint dwInput)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Converts platform-independent FPU control word flags to platform-specific bit flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize output to 0\n2. For each input flag bit (0x1, 0x4, 0x8, 0x10, 0x20, 0x2), map to corresponding output bits (0x10, 0x8, 0x4, 0x2, 0x1, 0x80000)\n3. For bits 0xc00 (11:10), map to 0x300 (9:8) output range\n4. For bits 0x300 (9:8), set 0x20000 or 0x10000 in output\n5. For bit 0x1000, set 0x40000 in output\n\nParameters:\n- dwInput (uint): Platform input flags\n\nReturns:\n- uint: Mapped platform-specific FPU control word flags",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
