      "name": "ShiftRight96Bit",
      "signature": "void ShiftRight96Bit(dword * pBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Right shift 96-bit value (3 dwords) by 1 bit.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load third dword into temp\n2. Shift second dword right, OR with third dword shifted left\n3. Shift third dword right\n4. Shift first dword right, OR with temp shifted left\n\nUsed in floating-point decimal conversion.\n\nParameters:\n- pBuffer (dword*): Pointer to 3 dwords representing 96-bit value\n\nReturns:\n- void (operates in-place on buffer)",
