      "name": "Pow2F64",
      "signature": "float10 Pow2F64(float10 * __return_storage_ptr__, float10 ldExponent)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "float10 *",
      "comment": "Computes 2^x using x87 FPU extended precision arithmetic.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load input value into ST0\n2. FRNDINT: Round to nearest integer\n3. FSUBR: Compute fractional part = input - rounded(input)\n4. FCHS/F2XM1: Compute 2^(fractional) - 1 via F2XM1\n5. FLD1/FADDP: Add 1 to get 2^(fractional)\n6. FSCALE: Multiply by 2^(integer part) to get final result\n\nParameters:\n- nExponent (float10): Input exponent (passed in ST0 by x87 calling convention)\n\nReturns:\n- 2^nExponent as float10 extended precision value",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
