      "name": "RemoveListNode",
      "signature": "void RemoveListNode(int * * ppListHead, int nValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Removes a node from a singly-linked list by value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load head pointer from ppListHead\n2. Traverse list comparing each node's value to nValue\n3. If node found at head, update ppListHead to skip it\n4. If node found in middle, update previous node's next pointer\n5. Call ReleasePoolAllocation to free the node\n6. Return silently if value not found in list\n\nParameters:\n- ppListHead (int **): Pointer to list head pointer (modified in-place)\n- nValue (int): Value to search for and remove\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
