      "name": "GetMaskedVolumeFactor",
      "signature": "uint GetMaskedVolumeFactor(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Returns masked volume factor if game is active.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call GetGameState to check if game is running\n2. Convert result to boolean mask (all-ones or all-zeros)\n3. AND with global volume factor to get masked result\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- g_dwVolumeFactor if game state is active, 0 otherwise",
