      "comment": "Left-shift a 96-bit value stored in three 32-bit words by one bit position.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load three consecutive 32-bit values from pointer\n2. Shift low word left 1 bit\n3. Shift middle word left 1 bit, OR with low word's MSB\n4. Shift high word left 1 bit, OR with middle word's MSB\n\nParameters:\n- pdwValue (uint*): Pointer to three consecutive 32-bit words representing 96-bit value\n\nReturns:\n- void (modifies values in-place)",
