      "signature": "DWORD * InitializeThreadLocalStorage(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "DWORD *",
      "comment": "Initializes thread-local storage for context data. Allocates and sets up TLS slot with thread ID.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get current error code to preserve\n2. Retrieve TLS value for thread slot\n3. If not allocated, allocate new structure (74 bytes)\n4. Set TLS value for this thread\n5. Initialize context structure with thread ID and sentinel value\n6. Restore error code\n\nParameters:\n- None\n\nReturns:\n- Pointer to TLS structure (DWORD*) on success\n- Exits on allocation/TLS failure via __amsg_exit",
