      "name": "ProcessStringCharacters",
      "signature": "void ProcessStringCharacters(char * szString)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Process and manipulate string characters via conditional transformation.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Read first character and check via FUN_6f9e7dbd (code 0x65)\n2. If not 0x65, increment pointer and conditionally transform character\n3. Perform character swapping loop to shuffle string from position\n4. Replace characters with temporary value from DAT_6f9f0e1c\n\nParameters:\n- szString (char*): Pointer to string to process\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nRelated: FUN_6f9e7dbd (character validation), FUN_6f9e7d48 (character transform)",
