      "name": "GetLinkedListNodeCount",
      "signature": "int GetLinkedListNodeCount(LinkedListNode * pListHead)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Counts the number of nodes in a linked list by traversing next pointers.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Initialize counter to 0\n2. Test if list head pointer is NULL\n3. If NULL, return 0 immediately\n4. Loop: Load next pointer from offset 0x4 in current node\n5. Increment counter on each iteration\n6. Test if next pointer is NULL to determine loop exit\n7. Return total node count\n\nParameters:\n- pListHead (LinkedListNode*): Pointer to first node in list; each node has next pointer at offset 0x4\n\nReturns:\n- int: Total count of nodes in the list; returns 0 if list is empty (NULL head)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
      "index": "MNE:8df9bf85cb3834dff82ac22642075af4",
