      "name": "GetCodePageForLocale",
      "signature": "int GetCodePageForLocale(int nCodePageId)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Returns the appropriate code page identifier for locale mapping.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If nCodePageId == -2: Return OEM code page (GetOEMCP)\n2. If nCodePageId == -3: Return ANSI code page (GetACP)\n3. If nCodePageId == -4: Return stored default code page from DAT_6f9f3f4c\n4. Otherwise: Return nCodePageId unchanged\n\nParameters:\n- nCodePageId (int): Code page identifier (-2, -3, -4, or explicit CP value)\n\nReturns:\n- Code page identifier (int)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- -2: OEM code page sentinel\n- -3: ANSI code page sentinel\n- -4: Stored default code page sentinel",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
