      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Cleans up all critical section objects in the global array.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load address of global critical section array (0x6f9f0bf0)\n2. Iterate through array until end address (0x6f9f0cb0)\n3. For each non-NULL entry that is not one of the 4 special critical sections:\n   - Call DeleteCriticalSection to clean up the critical section\n   - Call FUN_6f9e79bf for additional cleanup\n4. Explicitly clean up the 4 special critical sections (g_pCriticalSection1-4)\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: EDI contains DeleteCriticalSection function pointer\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)",
