      "name": "UpdateMemoryPageValue",
      "signature": "void UpdateMemoryPageValue(int nMemContext, int nPageOffset, byte * pbValue)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Increments memory page value counter and triggers cleanup at threshold.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Calculate page field offset using structure base and page index\n2. Increment the target field by the provided byte value\n3. Clear the input byte and set control marker to 0xf1\n4. Check if threshold (0x20) is reached and invoke page memory cleanup\n\nParameters:\n- pMemContext (int): Pointer to memory context structure\n- nPageOffset (int): Page offset from base reference point\n- pbValue (byte*): Input byte value to add to page counter\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x18: Offset to page array in context structure\n- 0x10: Reference offset for page calculation\n- 0xc (12): Bits to shift for page stride calculation\n- 0xf1: Page control marker value\n- 0xf0: Page completion threshold marker\n- 0x20 (32): Maximum page count before cleanup trigger",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
