      "name": "CopyBufferForward",
      "signature": "void CopyBufferForward(char * lpszBuffer, dword nSize)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Copies buffer contents forward by specified offset, with optional conditional execution based on offset value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if nOffset is non-zero\n2. If offset is zero, return without action\n3. If offset is non-zero: measure pszBuffer length with strlen()\n4. Call FUN_6f9e85c0 to copy from pszBuffer to (pszBuffer + nOffset), copying (length + 1) bytes\n\nParameters:\n- pszBuffer (char*): Source buffer to copy forward\n- nOffset (dword): Offset to advance buffer pointer; if 0, no action performed\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return value)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- +1: Include null terminator in copy operation",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
