      "name": "LoadMathConstant",
      "signature": "void LoadMathConstant(dword nConstantFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Loads mathematical constants based on bit flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Test bit 0 (0x1) - Load extended double at 0x6f9f358c, convert to int, store\n2. Test bit 3 (0x8) - Load extended double at 0x6f9f358c, store as double on stack\n3. Test bit 4 (0x10) - Load extended double at 0x6f9f3598, store as double on stack\n4. Test bit 2 (0x4) - Compute 0/1 (infinity), store on stack\n5. Test bit 5 (0x20) - Load PI, store as double on stack\n\nParameters:\n- nConstantFlags (dword): Bit flags controlling which constants to load\n  - 0x01: Load/convert constant at 0x6f9f358c\n  - 0x04: Compute infinity (0/1)\n  - 0x08: Load constant at 0x6f9f358c as double\n  - 0x10: Load constant at 0x6f9f3598\n  - 0x20: Load PI\n\nReturns:\n- void (values stored in FPU stack and/or memory)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
