      "name": "ExtractModuleVersionBytes",
      "signature": "void ExtractModuleVersionBytes(dword * pVersionBytes)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Extracts version information bytes from loaded module PE header.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get handle to current module via GetModuleHandleA(NULL)\n2. Check PE signature (0x5A4D \"MZ\")\n3. Read offset to NT headers from PE header at +0x3C\n4. Extract major and minor version bytes from +0x1A and +0x1B in NT headers\n5. Store extracted bytes in output buffer\n\nParameters:\n- pVersionBytes (dword*): Output buffer to store version bytes (2 bytes)\n\nReturns:\n- void (fills output buffer in place)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- GetModuleHandleA: Retrieves module base address",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
