      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Performs cleanup of registered exit handlers and process termination.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call pre-exit hook (FUN_6f9e5a3b)\n2. Check global exit flag (DAT_6f9f3d64) - if set, terminate immediately with exit code\n3. Set cleanup flags (DAT_6f9f3d60=1) and store immediate flag as byte\n4. If nFlags==0, execute exit handlers in reverse order and call cleanup functions\n5. If bImmediate==0, call ExitProcess(nExitCode) with no return\n6. Otherwise call final cleanup function (FUN_6f9e5a44)\n\nParameters:\n- nExitCode (uint): Process exit code passed to ExitProcess\n- nFlags (int): Control flag - 0 triggers exit handler cleanup, non-0 skips handlers\n- bImmediate (int): Determines if process should exit immediately (0=exit, non-0=return)\n\nReturns:\n- void (no return if bImmediate==0)\n\nRelated Functions:\n- DoCleanup, __exit, ExitWithCode (callers)\n- FUN_6f9e5a3b (pre-exit hook)\n- FUN_6f9e5a4d (cleanup handler)\n- FUN_6f9e5a44 (final cleanup)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
