      "signature": "int GetFPUStatusWord(void)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Retrieves the current x87 FPU status word.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Execute FSTSW instruction to save x87 FPU status word to stack\n2. Sign-extend 16-bit status word to 32-bit signed integer\n3. Return status word value in EAX\n\nParameters:\n- IMPLICIT: x87 FPU (status word contains exception flags and condition codes)\n\nReturns:\n- EAX: FPU status word as signed 32-bit integer (bits 0-15 contain status, upper 16 bits are sign-extended)",
