      "name": "InitializeSoundEngine",
      "signature": "void InitializeSoundEngine(uint dwContext)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initializes the sound engine by enumerating audio devices and validating driver versions.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Store context parameter to global (DAT_6f9f3ca0)\n2. Enumerate DirectSound devices via callback\n3. For each detected device (EMU10K1, CRLDS3D):\n   - Get Windows directory and construct driver path\n   - Query driver version via FUN_6f9e5600\n   - Validate version against expected ranges\n   - Set error flag if version mismatch\n4. Initialize DirectSound with up to 3 configuration attempts\n5. Log initialization status and errors\n\nParameters:\n- dwContext (uint): Context value stored in global state\n\nReturns:\n- void (returns after logging completion)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x104 (260): Buffer size for Windows path\n- 0x26e-0x2c6: Valid EMU10K1 VXD revision range (v4.6)\n- 0x274-0x275: Valid CRLDS3D VXD revision range (v11.0)\n- 0x40b (1035): CRLDS3D revision threshold check",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:c3b6abf16dc6acc5cd76aa2a8156ad9e",
