      "name": "DisplayMessageBox",
      "signature": "int DisplayMessageBox(dword hWnd, char * szText, dword uType)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Displays a message box with dynamic window and message content. Lazy-initializes user32.dll function pointers on first call.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if MessageBoxA pointer cached (g_pfnMessageBoxA)\n2. If not cached, load user32.dll and resolve MessageBoxA, GetActiveWindow, GetLastActivePopup\n3. Get active window handle via GetActiveWindow, then call GetLastActivePopup for topmost child\n4. Call MessageBoxA with resolved handle and provided message/caption/type\n5. Return result from MessageBoxA\n\nParameters:\n- hWnd (dword): Parent window handle for message box\n- szText (char*): Message text to display\n- uType (dword): Message box style flags (buttons, icons, etc.)\n\nReturns:\n- Result from MessageBoxA (1=OK, 2=Cancel, etc., 0 if initialization failed)",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
